          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ፋሲካውን ጠንቅቆ ይቆጥራል",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 29,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪ወዓርገ እግዚእ ኢየሱስ ኢየ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 30,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ሩሳሌም ።⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 31,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ጌታ ወደ ኢየሩሳሌም ወጣ ።",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 32,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "section_title",
          "text": "ዘከመ ተሰዱ ሠየጥ እምኵራብ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 33,
          "margin_tag": "፲፬",
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪ወረከበ በምኵራብ እለ ይሠ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 34,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ይጡ ወይሣየጡ አልሕምተ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 35,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ወአባግዓ ወአርጋበ ወመወል",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 36,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ጣነ እንዘ ይነብሩ ።⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 37,
          "margin_tag": "፲፬",
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "በመቅደስ ላም በግ ርግብ የ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 38,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ሚሸጡትን ተቀምጠው ማለ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "column_index": 3,
      "lines": [
        {
          "line_num": 1,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ት ገበያ አድርገው አገኘ ።",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 2,
          "margin_tag": "፲፭",
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪ወገብረ መቅሠፍተ ጥብጣቤ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 3,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ዘሐብል ።⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 4,
          "margin_tag": "፲፭",
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ዘሐፂን አለና ዘሐብል አለ፡ማ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 5,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ሠሪያ አበጀ ፤ እርሱ አላበጀም",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 6,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ሐዋርያት አብጅተው ሰጥተው",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 7,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ታል የጭፍራውንም ላለቃው",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 8,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ሰጥቶ መናገር ልማድ ነው ።",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 9,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ወከመዝ ገብረ ሙሴ በዘሚር",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 10,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ወበአክሲኖዶስ እንዲል ።",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 11,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪ወሰደደ ኵሎ እምኵራብ አባ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 12,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ግዓኒ ወአልሕምተኒ ።⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 13,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ላሙን በጉን ሁሉ ከምኵራብ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 14,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "አስወጣ ማለት ገበያውን ፈታ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 15,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪ወዘረወ ወርቆሙ ለመወልጣን⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 16,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "የለዋጮችን ገንዘባቸውን በተ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 17,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ነባቸው ። የሰው ገንዘብ አታበ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 18,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ላሹ ይል የለም ቢሉ ለሰው",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 19,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ነታቸው ቤዛ ሁኗቸዋል ። ማ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 20,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ዕሰ ቤዛ ማዕስ እንዲል ። አን",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 21,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ድም በተአምራት ገንዘብ ገ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 22,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ንዘባቸውን ለይቶ ይሰጣቸዋል",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 23,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "አንድም ከዛፍ ላይ እንደ ሰ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 24,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ፈረ ንብ ከቃ ከቃቸው ላይ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 25,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "እየተጣበቀ ተገኝቷል ።",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 26,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪ወገፍትዓ ማዕዳቲሆሙ ።⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 27,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ድርድራቸውን ሰፈራቸውን አ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 28,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ፈረሰ ።",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 29,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪ወመናብርቲሆሙ ለእለ ይሠ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 30,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ይጡ ርግበ ገንጰለ ።⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 31,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ርግብ የሚሸጡትንም ወንበራ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 32,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ቸውን ገለበጠባቸው ፤ ቋንጤ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 33,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ወንበር አላቸው ከዚያ ሁነው",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 34,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ርግብ ይሸጣሉ የከተማ ቅራ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 35,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "በወንበር ሁና ዶሮ እንድትሸጥ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 36,
          "margin_tag": "፲፮",
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪ወይቤሎሙ ለእለ ይሠይጡ ር",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 37,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ግበ አሰስሉ ወአውጽኡ ዘንተ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
